            "review_title": "Review at Thai Binh BBQ",
            "review_text": "Mike D\nLondon, United Kingdom66 contributions\n0\nOk\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nPopped in a few times due to the limited options around. Evening service was fine but lunchtime service was pretty poor. Young lads were keen and friendly but we had to resort to getting photos of Schweppes Tonic Water on the phone to show them what we wanted. We'd already been given it the night before....\n\nThree dishes between the two of us on the first night we visited came at 20 minute intervals. I had given up and asked for the bill before the third one actually arrived. Food was OK - beef, mixed udon noodles and fried pork but nothing special. Food on the second night was a bit better - stewed beef and potatoes / beef noodles and pork skewers. Draught beer at vnd 20,000 was good value.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 28, 2020",
            "rating": 1.0,
